export anchor ExchangeBoardStyle:
    number: 76
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Exchange board
    idea: The dashboard reads like a light trading-floor board, with projects quoted as tickers carrying a last price, a depth bar and an up, hold or down signal, over a static ticker tape and a volume chart.
    base: light
    palette:
        floor: #eceee9, the page
        board: #ffffff, panes and table rows, zebra rows in #f7f8f5
        grid: #c8ccc4, cell rules and pane borders
        ink: #101820, text, depth bars and the primary button
        slate: #4c5660, labels and hatching
        headerNavy: #13263f, the nav bar, the table head and this week bars
        tape: #fff3c4, the ticker band
        lamp: #ffd84d, the current nav tab and the focus halo
        upGreen: #11703d, On track on a #e3f3e8 chip
        holdAmber: #8a5200, At risk on a #fbefd6 chip
        downRed: #b4161b, Behind and overdue on a #fbe4e3 chip
        wireBlue: #0d4f9e, links, newswire times and the focus ring
    type:
        Numbers and codes use ui-monospace, SF Mono, Cascadia Mono, Menlo,
        Consolas with tabular figures. Words use Helvetica Neue, Arial
        Narrow, Arial. Index values are 34px bold mono, the greeting 28px
        at 800, last prices 17px at 800 mono, project names 14px bold sans,
        cells 13px mono, table heads 11px bold mono caps on navy and chart
        labels 12px mono.
    layout:
        A white top row holds a rising arrow mark, Brightwork and a boxed
        BWX code, the date as SAT 31 OCT 2026 WEEKEND SESSION, a FIND
        search box with a black label, a + New project button, an ALERTS
        box with a red 3 and DESK Mara Okafor. A navy nav bar follows with
        Home lit yellow, then a pale yellow ticker tape listing each project
        code with its percent and signal and the week total, scrolling
        sideways inside itself. The greeting row has the heading, the date
        in mono and a red bordered 4 TASKS OVERDUE flash with a down
        triangle. Four index boxes share one bordered strip with codes ACTV,
        DUE.WK, OVRD and HRS.WK and big right-aligned values. The main grid
        has a Project quotes table with columns Sym, Project, Sector, Last,
        Depth, Tasks, Due and Signal, invented codes WEBR, MOB2, Q4SV,
        BILL, SPRC and ONBE, a segmented depth bar and a signal chip. The
        right column stacks a Volume chart with hatched bars for last week
        and navy bars this week, a three-cell strip for 59, 73 and the
        change, and a Newswire list. At 375px the table scrolls inside its
        pane and the index boxes go two by two.
    spacing: A 4px base with 8px most gaps. Cells are 9px by 10px and panes sit 14px apart.
    density: High. Tabular rows and small mono figures.
    corners: Square everywhere.
    borders: 1px grid lines, a 2px ink rule under each pane title and zebra rows.
    shadows: None. Depth comes from the navy header bands.
    icons:
        Market glyphs only. An up triangle for On track, a diamond for At
        risk and a down triangle for Behind and overdue, always with the
        word in a tinted chip.
    focus: A 2px wire blue outline offset 1px with a 4px yellow lamp halo.
    tone: Terse trader codes such as ACTV, DUE.WK, OVRD, Newswire, 12m and YDAY.
